agraph","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"The group met for the first time under the new governance structure on Monday, September 21, 2026, and much of the session was dedicated to welcoming two new member institutions: UCSF, whose ","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"key":"W658oDLoOW"},{"type":"link","url":"https://ssc.ucsf.edu/","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Scientific Software Core","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"key":"N0bzjXbCgr"}],"urlSource":"https://ssc.ucsf.edu/","key":"ANb7yvUdDM"},{"type":"text","value":" has been running for about a year, and UC Law SF, whose ","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"key":"iwO2JE7uVR"},{"type":"link","url":"https://www.uclawsf.edu/lexlab/","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"LexLab","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"key":"NcGZHq4llA"}],"urlSource":"https://www.uclawsf.edu/lexlab/","key":"MiMZoijQ5i"},{"type":"text","value":" is at an earlier stage. They join established campus OSPOs at UC Berkeley, UC Davis, UCLA, UC San Diego, UC Santa Barbara and UC Santa Cruz. Delegates from the Alignment Group also attended.","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"key":"EdWJ7SiHpZ"}],"key":"xrz03xXh2V"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"The bulk of the meeting was spent on what it takes to stand up an OSPO, with each established campus describing how theirs came about and the new members describing what they’re facing now. A few themes came up repeatedly:","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"key":"GtO4aAb2UF"}],"key":"QmX58kmWVz"},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"spread":false,"position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":17,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Libraries, research offices and engineering schools each bring different reach, and the answer to the question of where to house a campus OSPO often depends on who the current campus champion is rather than on an org chart","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"key":"miMXdmqWSg"}],"key":"trbtTDXrKV"}],"key":"EqD73HY7gN"},{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":14,"column":1},"end":{"line":14,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Student engagement tends to come more easily than engagement with faculty and researchers","position":{"start":{"line":14,"column":1},"end":{"line":14,"column":1}},"key":"EoNLJeh7vG"}],"key":"Yp2ntEvFrH"}],"key":"qkk5wksTKx"},{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Researchers and project maintainers are often wary of working with tech transfer and appreciate the OSPO as sort of a translation layer, helping them to get their duckies in a row before going to tech transfer, and tech transfer needs to be confident in its relationship with the OSPO, not feel like the OSPO is cutting tech transfer out of the picture","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"key":"DqU7AZMvYV"}],"key":"gEN2IRUOZU"}],"key":"ODwJXaifFq"},{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":17,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Funding and help approaching campus leadership are the biggest asks for new 